  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 6. First factor A_A = <k1^{u/h} Q_1^A>, the L1-mathcalA definition with the measure built from SITE 1 only:\n   mu = 1/(ν1^(1)(u) ν1^(1)(u+h) ... ν1^(1)(u+d h)), d = λ1 - λ2, ν1^(1)(u) = u - θ1 - h λ1, poles θ1 + n h, n = λ2..λ1 (no θ2 poles),\n   normalized by f at the lowest pole θ1 + λ2 h, Nn making the constant term 1. Q_1 is the L = 2 one (deg 2 λ1 - μ1).\n   Result: v . Psi_A = A_A with <v| = <v1| (x) <vacL|, <v1| the L = 1 covector (1 - k1 z1)^d e1^T e^{p1' E12} e^{p2 E13} e^{p3 E23},\n   p1' = p1 (1 - k1 z2)/(1 - k1 z1). ---- *)\nClearAll[degA2, nu1site1A2, muA2, polesA2, resMuA2, NnA2, fA2, calA2, vA2, v0A2, p1pA2, v1siteA2, candA2];\ndegA2 = repT[[1]] - repT[[2]];\nnu1site1A2[x_] := x - thT[[1]] - hT repT[[1]];\nmuA2[x_] := 1 / Product[nu1site1A2[x + k hT], {k, 0, degA2}];\npolesA2 = thT[[1]] + hT Range[repT[[2]], repT[[1]]];\nresMuA2 = Table[Residue[muA2[x], {x, p}], {p, polesA2}];\nNnA2 = 1 / resMuA2[[1]];\n\nfA2[A_, x_] := k1^(x / hT) QdT[A, 1, x];\ncalA2 = Table[Expand[PowerExpand[NnA2 / fA2[A, polesA2[[1]]] Sum[resMuA2[[m]] fA2[A, polesA2[[m]]], {m, Length[polesA2]}]]], {A, dcT}];\n\n(* columns of ketMatT are the kets; v . ketMatT = A row *)\nvA2 = Expand[calA2 . Inverse[ketMatT]];\nv0A2 = Coefficient[vA2, k1, 0];\n\n(* L = 1 result of L1-mathcalA on site 1, vacL on site 2; Together makes it polynomial in k1 *)\np1pA2 = p1T (1 - k1 zT[[2]]) / (1 - k1 zT[[1]]);\nv1siteA2 = Expand[Together[(1 - k1 zT[[1]])^degA2 UnitVector[dsT, 1] . MatrixExp[p1pA2 Normal[ElT[1, 2]]] . MatrixExp[p2T Normal[ElT[1, 3]]] . MatrixExp[p3T Normal[ElT[2, 3]]]]];\ncandA2 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1siteA2, vacL1T]];\n\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"poles (θ1 + n h)\", polesA2},\n        {\"residues of mu, Nn\", {resMuA2, NnA2}},\n        {\"A_A polynomial in k1, degree\", {And @@ (PolynomialQ[#, k1] & /@ calA2), Union[Exponent[#, k1] & /@ calA2]}},\n        {\"min |Q_1(θ1 + λ2 h)| over states\", N[Min[Table[Abs[QdT[A, 1, polesA2[[1]]]], {A, dcT}]], 3]},\n        {\"k1^0 part of v = vacL (x) vacL\", N[Max[Abs[v0A2 - vacLT]], 3]},\n        {\"max |v . Psi_A - A_A|\", N[Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[vA2 . ketMatT - calA2, k1]]]], 3]},\n        {\"|v - v1(L=1) (x) vacL|, all orders in k1\", N[Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[vA2 - candA2, k1]]]], 3]}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"389651\" data-output-id=\"62\" data-out-n=\"846\" data-sub-idx=\"17\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"5\" data-sub-start=\"25\" data-sub-end=\"36\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[846]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.46em;vertical-align:-3.96em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.5em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.46em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.46em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.42em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.96em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.46em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">poles (</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">1 + n h)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">residues of mu, Nn</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">A_A polynomial in k1, degree</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min |Q_1(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">1 + </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">2 h)| over states</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">k1</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">0 part of v = vacL (x) vacL</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max |v . Psi_A - A_A|</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">|v - v1(L=1) (x) vacL|, all orders in k1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.96em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.42em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.96em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.46em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstru