vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.42em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.96em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.46em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.46em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.46em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.46em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.46em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.46em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.46em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.92em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.46em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.96em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[846]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{poles ($\\theta$1 + n h)} & \\left\\{\\frac{7}{3},\\frac{10}{3},\\frac{13}{3}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{residues of mu, Nn} & \\left\\{\\left\\{\\frac{1}{2},-1,\\frac{1}{2}\\right\\},2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{A\\_A polynomial in k1, degree} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\left\\{2\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{min |Q\\_1($\\theta$1 + $\\lambda$2 h)| over states} & 0.0115\\\\\\hline\\text{k1\\^{}0 part of v = vacL (x) vacL} & 0.\\times 10^{-86}\\\\\\hline\\text{max |v . Psi\\_A - A\\_A|} & 0.\\times 10^{-78}\\\\\\hline\\text{|v - v1(L=1) (x) vacL|, all orders in k1} & 0.\\times 10^{-85}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "d4544f01-6e76-4dac-b727-d50ec297e057"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### The 2×2 determinant $\\det\\begin{pmatrix}\\langle k_1^{u/h}Q_1\\rangle_1&\\langle k_1^{u/h}uQ_1\\rangle_1\\\\\\langle k_1^{u/h}Q_1\\rangle_2&\\langle k_1^{u/h}uQ_1\\rangle_2\\end{pmatrix}$\n\n$\\langle f\\rangle_\\alpha=\\oint \\dfrac{e^{2\\pi i(\\alpha-1)u/h}\\,f(u)}{\\prod_{k=0}^{d}\\nu_1(u+kh)}$ with the **two-site** $\\nu_1(u)=\\prod_s(u-\\theta_s-h\\lambda_1)$, $d=\\lambda_1-\\lambda_2$ (for the adjoint: $1/(\\nu_1(u)\\nu_1(u+h))$). Poles $\\theta_s+nh$, $n=\\lambda_2..\\lambda_1$, on both sites. Expected: $\\propto\\langle v_1\\otimes v_1|\\Psi_A\\rangle$, the same rotation on both sites.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 7. Two-site 2x2 determinant of <k1^{u/h} u^b Q_1>_alpha, alpha = 1, 2, b = 0, 1.\n   The exponentials are split off by hand: at a pole x = θ_s + n h, e^{2πi(α-1)x/h} = e_s^(α-1) and k1^{x/h} = k1^{θ_s/h} k1^n.\n   Since the α-dependence is only through e_s, the determinant is (e2 - e1) x det over sites; we divide by (e2 - e1) and by k1^{(θ1+θ2)/h + 2 λ2}\n   (drop the k1^{θ_s/h}, count k1 from the lowest pole) and by Q_1(θ1 + λ2 h) Q_1(θ2 + λ2 h). Then fit v with v . Psi_A = D_A and compare with v1 (x) v1. ---- *)\nClearAll[polesD, muD, resD, brD, detD, vD, candD, ratioD, nzD];\npolesD = Flatten[Table[{s, n}, {s, 2}, {n, repT[[2]], repT[[1]]}], 1];\nmuD[x_] := 1 / Product[nuT[1][x + k hT], {k, 0, degA2}];\nresD = Table[Residue[muD[x], {x, thT[[p[[1]]]] + p[[2]] hT}], {p, polesD}];\n(* site-s part of <k1^{u/h} u^b Q_1>, i.e. the coefficient of e_s^(α-1) *)\nbrD[A_, s_, b_] := Sum[With[{p = polesD[[r]]}, If[p[[1]] == s, With[{x = thT[[s]] + p[[2]] hT}, resD[[r]] k1^(p[[2]] - repT[[2]]) x^b QdT[A, 1, x]], 0]], {r, Length[polesD]}];\n(* det [[B1(e1^0) + B2(e2^0), ...],[B1 e1 + B2 e2, ...]] = (e2 - e1) (B1[0] B2[1] - B2[0] B1[1]) *)\ndetD = Table[Expand[(brD[A, 1, 0] brD[A, 2, 1] - brD[A, 2, 0] brD[A, 1, 1]) / (QdT[A, 1, thT[[1]] + repT[[2]] hT] QdT[A, 1, thT[[2]] + repT[[2]] hT])], {A, dcT}];\nvD = Expand[detD . Inverse[ketMatT]];\ncandD = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1siteA2, v1siteA2]];\n(* conversion factor: v / (v1 (x) v1) on the nonzero components, at a few k1 *)\nnzD = Flatten @ Position[Abs[candD /. k1 -> 1/7], _?(# > 10^-30 &)];\nratioD = Table[(vD[[i]] / candD[[i]]) /. k1 -> kk, {kk, {1/7, 3/11, -3}}, {i, nzD}];\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"poles {s, n}\", polesD},\n        {\"D_A polynomial in k1, degrees\", {And @@ (PolynomialQ[#, k1] & /@ detD), Union[Exponent[#, k1] & /@ detD]}},\n        {\"# components of v1 (x) v1 nonzero / zero\", {Length[nzD], dcT - Length[nzD]}},\n        {\"max |v| on the zero components of v1 (x) v1 (k1 = 1/7)\", N[Max[Abs[Delete[vD /. k1 -> 1/7, List /@ nzD]]], 3]},\n        {\"ratio v/(v1 (x) v1): spread over components, per k1\", N[Max[Abs[# - Mean[#]]] & /@ ratioD, 3]},\n        {\"ratio (mean), per k1\", N[Mean /@ ratioD, 12]}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"389651\" data-output-id=\"63\" data-out-n=\"857\" data-sub-idx=\"14\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"17\" data-sub-end=\"27\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[857]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:13.25em;vertical-align:-6.355em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.895em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.855em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.855em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:13.21em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-6.355em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.855em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.855em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">poles {s, n}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.665em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">D_A polynomial in k1, degrees</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.465em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># components of v1 (x) v1 nonzero / zero</span></span></span></span><span st