  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 8. Ledger (never cleared): set repT / ptIndexT, re-run cells 3-9. The constant C in v = C (v1 (x) v1) is compared with\n   C = (-1)^d / ((d!)^2 h^{2d} prod_{n=-d..d} (θ12 - n h)),  d = λ1 - λ2,\n   read off [2,1,0] at points 1-3 (sign, h^-2, the θ12 product) and [3,1,0] at point 1 (the 1/(d!)^2); the last column is C / guess. ---- *)\nIf[! AssociationQ[resultsD], resultsD = <||>];\ncD = Rationalize[Mean[ratioD[[1]]], 10^-70];\nguessD[rep_, pt_] := With[{d = rep[[1]] - rep[[2]], hh = ptListT[[pt, 1]], t12 = ptListT[[pt, 2, 1]] - ptListT[[pt, 2, 2]]},\n    (-1)^d / (d!^2 hh^(2 d) Product[t12 - n hh, {n, -d, d}])];\nresultsD[{repT, ptIndexT}] = {\n    dcT,\n    N[Max[Abs[Flatten[ratioD - cD]]], 3],\n    N[Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[vD - cD candD, k1]]]], 3],\n    cD\n};\nGrid[\n    Prepend[KeyValueMap[Join[{Row[#1[[1]], \",\"], #1[[2]]}, #2, {#2[[4]] / guessD @@ #1}] &, resultsD],\n        {\"rep\", \"point\", \"dim\", \"spread of C (components, k1)\", \"|v - C v1 (x) v1|, all orders in k1\", \"C\", \"C / guess\"}],\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
