   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Times the second factor $\\langle k_2^{u/h}p(u)Q_{12}\\rangle$ of `L2-mathcalA.wb`\n\nSame functional as there: contour only around $\\theta_1,\\dots,\\theta_1+\\lambda_2h$, measure $m(u)=p(u)/\\prod_{k=0}^{\\lambda_2}\\nu^{(1)}_3(u-kh)$, $p(u)=1/\\prod_{n=\\lambda_2+1}^{\\lambda_1}(u-\\theta_2-nh)$, normalized at $\\theta_1$. Question: is $D_A F_A = C\\,\\langle v_1\\otimes v_1|\\sum_m(-1)^m\\binom{\\lambda_2}{m}k_2^m\\,t^{(1)}_{\\{m,m\\}}(\\theta_1)\\otimes1|\\Psi_A\\rangle$, i.e. does $k_2$ still act on site 1 only?\n\n**Yes** (checked $[2,1,0]$ pt 1, $[3,1,0]$ pt 2, $[3,2,0]$ pt 3; all orders in $k_1,k_2$, residual $\\le10^{-80}$). The fitted per-$m$ constants $c'_m$ with $\\langle v_1\\otimes v_1|$ equal $\\rho_m=p(\\theta_1+mh)/p(\\theta_1)$ exactly, i.e. the same $c_m$ as with $\\langle v_1\\otimes\\mathrm{vacL}|$: rotating site 2 does not change them. Ledger of this check: `resultsF` (scratch, kernel only).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 9. D_A x F_A vs C <v1 (x) v1| sum_m (-1)^m binom(λ2, m) k2^m t_mm(θ1) (x) 1 |Psi_A>.\n   F_A, Y, t_mm, p are exactly the definitions of L2-mathcalA cell 10. Also fit c'_m in C <v1 v1| t_mm (x) 1 |Psi_A> = c'_m D_A Y_{m,A}\n   (at L2-mathcalA, with <v1 (x) vacL|, these were c_m = rho_m = p(θ1 + m h)/p(θ1)). ---- *)\nClearAll[Q12T, YA2, T1siteT, qmin1siteT, tG1siteT, tmmT, nuSiteT, pT, measA2, FA2, lhsMD, cMD, cSpreadD, finalResD, kTestD];\nQ12T[A_, x_] := QdT[A, 1, x] QdT[A, 2, x - hT] - QdT[A, 2, x] QdT[A, 1, x - hT];\nYA2 = Table[Q12T[A, thT[[1]] + m hT] / Q12T[A, thT[[1]]], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}, {A, dcT}];\nT1siteT[i_, j_][x_] := (x - thT[[1]]) KroneckerDelta[i, j] IdentityMatrix[dsT] - hT Normal[ElT[j, i]];\nqmin1siteT[II_][x_] := Sum[Signature[s] Dot @@ Table[T1siteT[II[[s[[k]]]], II[[k]]][x - (k - 1) hT], {k, Length[II]}], {s, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\ntG1siteT[a_][x_] := Sum[(Times @@ zT[[II]]) qmin1siteT[II][x], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\ntmmT[0] = IdentityMatrix[dsT];\ntmmT[1] = With[{x = thT[[1]]}, tG1siteT[2][x] / (nu1site1A2[x] nu1site1A2[x - hT])];\ntmmT[2] = With[{x = thT[[1]]}, (tG1siteT[2][x] . tG1siteT[2][x + hT] - tG1siteT[3][x + hT] . tG1siteT[1][x]) / (nu1site1A2[x] nu1site1A2[x - hT] nu1site1A2[x + hT] nu1site1A2[x])];\nnuSiteT[s_, n_][x_] := x - thT[[s]] - hT repT[[n]];\npT[x_] := 1 / Product[x - thT[[2]] - n hT, {n, repT[[2]] + 1, repT[[1]]}];\nmeasA2[x_] := pT[x] / Product[nuSiteT[1, 3][x - k hT], {k, 0, repT[[2]]}];\nFA2 = Module[{x, res = Table[Residue[measA2[x], {x, thT[[1]] + m hT}], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}]},\n    Table[Sum[k2^m res[[m + 1]] / res[[1]] YA2[[m + 1, A]], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}], {A, dcT}]\n];\n(* operator side with the determinant covector C v1 (x) v1 *)\nlhsMD = Table[Expand[cD candD . N[KroneckerProduct[tmmT[m], IdentityMatrix[dsT]], precT] . ketMatT], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}];\nkTestD = {1/7, 3/11, -3};\n{cMD, cSpreadD} = Transpose @ Table[\n    With[{rr = Flatten @ Table[(lhsMD[[m + 1, A]] / (detD[[A]] YA2[[m + 1, A]])) /. k1 -> kk, {kk, kTestD}, {A, dcT}]},\n        {Rationalize[Mean[rr], 10^-60], N[Max[Abs[rr - Mean[rr]]], 3]}\n    ],\n    {m, 0, repT[[2]]}\n];\nfinalResD = Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[\n    Expand[detD FA2 - Sum[(-1)^m Binomial[repT[[2]], m] k2^m lhsMD[[m + 1]], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}]], {k1, k2}]]]];\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"site rep, point\", {repT, ptIndexT}},\n        {\"c'_m, m = 0..λ2 (fitted with v1 (x) v1)\", cMD},\n        {\"spread of c'_m over states and k1\", cSpreadD},\n        {\"rho_m = p(θ1 + m h)/p(θ1)\", Table[pT[thT[[1]] + m hT] / pT[thT[[1]]], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}]},\n        {\"max |D_A F_A - C <v1 v1| sum_m (-1)^m binom k2^m t_mm (x) 1 |Psi_A>|, all orders in k1, k2\", N[finalResD, 3]}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"389651\" data-output-id=\"65\" data-out-n=\"880\" data-sub-idx=\"19\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"10\" data-sub-start=\"29\" data-sub-end=\"38\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[880]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.07em;vertical-align:-2.765em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.305em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.265em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.265em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.03em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.765em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.265em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.425em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site rep, point</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.215em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">c’_m, m = 0..</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">2 (fitted with v1 (x) v1)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.005em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">spread of c’_m over states and k1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.795em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rho_m = p(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">1 + m h)/p(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">1)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.595em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max |D_A F_A - C &lt;v1 v1| sum_m (-1)</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">m binom k2</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">m t_mm (x) 1 |Psi_A&gt;|, all orders in k1, k2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.765em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.03em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.765em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.265em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.425em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.215em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">29</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bo